//= 发型染色师，提供标准色板
//===== Additional Comments: ================================= 
//= Fully working
//= 1.1 Bugfix: fixed missing menu label LEnd->M_End [Lupus]
//= 1.2 Rescripted to Aegis 10.3 standards. [L0ne_W0lf]
