//= 1.4 Fixed getlook checking the wrong color. (bugreport:2392) [L0ne_W0lf]
//= 1.5 Added Lighthalzen Hair Dying NPC. [L0ne_W0lf]
//= 1.6 Moving NPC Jovovich to Pre-Renewal [JohnnyPlayy]
